requirements and uses it as long as organization requires [2]. Private and Public Clouds are
\par
connected with each other through gateways to share data, applications and resources.KSII TRANSACTIONS ON INTERNET AND INFORMATION SYSTEMS VOL. 13, NO. 1, January 2019 409
