Software Agents are programmed and they require only specific and particular information toKSII TRANSACTIONS ON INTERNET AND INFORMATION SYSTEMS VOL. 13, NO. 1, January 2019 411
\par
be able to work in a certain environment [18]. When the Software Agent is able to perceive
