\par
may strike the reader as rather crude;15 evidence is delineated simply in terms of
\par
separate studies; there is a small set of meta-arguments, which form the basis for the
\par
reliability judgements; and, most importantly, the binary reliability judgments do not
\par
allow ruling in favour of one evidence piece over another in degrees. But perhaps
\par
this relatively crude structure does in fact strike the right balance between various
