\par
We comment that it would be very interesting to compare simulation methods with other
\par
means of estimating these complex processes, which may be effective at some spatial scales. It
\par
would be also useful to compare modern statistical learning algorithmic techniques to the well-
\par
established logistic-based modeling techniques. Developing methodology for combining these
\par
andothermodelstogetherinanensembleframework,therebybuildingonthebenefitsofeachof
\par
