is 110,569 km2 (Tebakari et al., 2012). The climate is tropic monsoon
\par
and the mean annual precipitation is about 1,200 mm. On average, 85\%
\par
of the total annual rainfall occurs between May and November (wet
\par
season), while the dry season is from December to April (Ponpang-Nga
\par
and Techamahasaranont, 2016).
