The Bhumibol Reservoir, constructed across the Ping river, is lo-
\par
cated at 17.24 degrees of North latitude and 98.97 degrees of East
\par
longitude, and is the largest reservoir in Thailand with multiannual
\par
ow regulation. It has a drainage area of 26,386 km2 with total storage
