\par
study generally improved the performance of traditional NARX (Dai
\par
et al., 2011; Ding et al., 2013; Jain and Srinivasulu, 2004; Sulistiyo
\par
et al., 2014; Yang et al., 2017). For all three reservoirs examined in this
