\par
Since the Bhumibol Reservoir has the longest records among three
\par
reservoirs and only its operation rule curves can be obtained, this study
\par
selects the Bhumibol Reservoir and further discusses the applicability of
\par
reservoir operation by GA-NARX through comparing with the existing
\par
operation rules. We also examine the model performance under ex-
\par
treme ood and drought conditions.
\par
To compare with the existing reservoir operation rules (also referred
\par
as operation rule curves), which de ne an empirically desired storage-
