\par
(ii) We assume that {$\xi$}i = L(-ai, bi), i= 1, 2, 3, are mutually independent linear uncertain variables with
\par
parameters left-width ai {$>$} 0 and right-width bi {$>$} 0.
\par
(iii) We assume that the MTO designs the time-based incentive contracts to induce the
\par
carriers to exert adequate efforts to complete their respective transportation stages, i.e.,
\par
