\par
(v) We suppose that the MTO's revenue depends linearly on the delivery time, i.e., R(T) = r0-r1T,
\par
where r0 indicates the maximum revenue for the entire carriage and r1 means the loss per unit time.
\par
In Assumption i, we define a linear function for modeling the relationship between the travel time
\par
and the effort level. We believe that reality is more complicated. However, this linear function can
\par
make analytical solutions accessible, thus enabling us to derive the closed form expression of the optimal
\par
