A. Forecast of BP neural network
\par
BP neural network is a multi-layer forward neural
\par
network based on Error Back Propagation Algorithm.
\par
It is comprised of input layer, implicit layer and output
\par
layer. Different layers connect each other but each
\par
layer of nerve cells has no connection. The neural
\par
network with structure single implicit layer is shown in
\par
Fig. 2. Generally speaking, simple forecast can be
\par
completed using network structure of single implicit
\par
layer.
\par
BP neural network forecast is to learn historical
\par
samples, find the nonlinear relations among data
\par
changes, store them in weight and threshold of network
\par
and forecast trend of future data.
\par
The procedures of forecasting periodical fluctuation
\par
items using BP neural network:
\par
\`A Design the structure of BP neural network.
