\par
To assess performance of the model, this part introduces
\par
the data of market demand of single variety in certain area
\par
of HN Company of agricultural means during the latest
\par
10 years (120 months). Use duplicate combined forecast
\par
model of time series decomposition and compare its fore-
\par
cast effect with that of other forecast models to verify
\par
forecast effect of the model.
