\par
This function considers the uncertainties associated with the quality of an inspection method by
\par
modelling the detectable crack size, {$ad$} , as a variable. The PoD function is also equal to the
\par
cumulative density function (CDF) of the variable {$ad$}, and treats an inspection result as imperfect by
\par
calculating a specific probability of detection for a given crack size.
\par
For the perfect inspection, the PoD function is defined by Equation (7).
