\par
respect to the time duration from the beginning of service time to time {$t$}, considering the influence of
\par
{$n$} maintenance interventions have been scheduled to the time duration. Lifetime fatigue reliability is
\par
the structural reliability against fatigue failure with respect to the required service life {$T$} {$SL$}.
