\par
the method used for calculation of structural response, stress concentration factor and the effect of
\par
welding notch, etc. In this paper, the uncertainties associated with calculation of ∆{$\sigma$} are modelled as
\par
an additional variable {$B$}, which follows a normal distribution with mean value {$E$}({$B$}) = 1 and standard
\par
