The study is based on secondary data, through reference to books and studies related to the subject of this study,
\par
and for the purposes of analysis have been refer to the websites of the banks included in the study sample, and
\par
the Amman Stock Exchange website, in order to obtain the financial statements of banks, and collect the
\par
necessary data on the study sample in addition to the websites of banks, in order to obtain financial reports, to
\par
examine their content and determine the level of disclosure of their sustainability practices.
\par
